    "sentence_translations": [
      "School District Houses",
      "",
      "Many people know that Chinese people like buying houses, ..",
      ".. but the houses that different Chinese people like to buy are not the same.",
      "",
      "Many Chinese people with children will buy a special type of house: school district houses.",
      "This type of house is often rather old and uncomfortable to live in, ..",
      ".. but sometimes can be even more expensive than new houses!",
      "",
      "Because many Chinese people hope that their children can go to a good school, ..",
      ".. but good schools can’t accept very many students.",
      "These schools can only accept students who live close to the school.",
      "So, many parents will, six years ahead of time, buy a house near those good schools, and live there.",
      "The houses near those good schools become expensive. These are school district houses.",
      "",
      "We can only say that mom and dad love their children too much!",
      "In order to let their children go to a good school, ..",
      ".. they will buy an old house and don’t mind if they live uncomfortably.",
      ""
